--           16 CHECK constraints, 2 COALESCE expression indexes), extracted from
--           the live database so the baseline is byte-faithful. See prisma/DRIFT.md.
--
-- On the existing test/prod DB this migration is marked applied via
-- `prisma migrate resolve --applied 0_init` (no SQL is run there).

